WEBVTT

00:00:09,580 --> 00:00:15,260
You were recommended a healthy mouth blend in my updated protocol.

00:00:15,260 --> 00:00:18,620
I noticed that it does contain some mint oils.

00:00:19,260 --> 00:00:24,220
I'm supposed to not have mint within an hour of my mobile pathic drops.

00:00:24,220 --> 00:00:28,780
Is there enough mint in this product that I need to make sure that I leave an hour

00:00:28,780 --> 00:00:32,620
between brushing with this and taking my homeopathic drops?

00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:35,340
The answer is yes.

00:00:35,340 --> 00:00:36,220
Yes, there is.

00:00:36,220 --> 00:00:38,780
That's the same thing with any other toothpaste, too.

00:00:38,780 --> 00:00:44,380
If you have a mint flavored toothpaste, remember you should not be using any

00:00:44,380 --> 00:00:47,100
holyopath within about an hour of that.

00:00:47,900 --> 00:00:56,060
So, mint, spearmint, peppermint can negate the effects of holyopathic drops.

00:00:56,060 --> 00:00:59,900
So, you don't want to be doing mint, uh,

00:00:59,900 --> 00:01:05,660
the lost edges, you don't want to be doing mint toothpaste within about 30 to 60

00:01:05,660 --> 00:01:08,060
minutes of taking a holyopath.

00:01:09,820 --> 00:01:17,820
So, just be careful of that.

